  "historyNote": "#8405, eff 8-2-05, (formerly Saf-C 1803.07); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24 New. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34",
